{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9582349a324f7966","name":"Morichro","source":{"id":"source:reference-9582349a324f7966","title":"Morichro","revision":19993,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:59:50Z","sha256":"4bec0937895ea4e840b45ff0ec1e0436abedc33969a30b92c132ec834b64bcea","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19993","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Morichro&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9582349a324f7966","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You slow the vital functions of a target, causing them to slip into a deep sleep or even die.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One living creature you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," Compare the result to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If you succeed, the target moves -1 step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". Each round you maintain this Force Power, if your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target moves another step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". If you move a target to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," with this Force Power, you can choose to kill the target or place it into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Trance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Trance"}," even if it is unwilling. Additionally, if you use this Force Power on an already unconscious target, you can consider the target willing for the purposes of putting them in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Trance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Trance"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can maintain ",{"tag":"i","children":["Morichro "]},"from round to round, extending the normal duration. Maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Morichro "]},"Force Power is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", and you must make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check each round. If you take damage while maintaining ",{"tag":"i","children":["Morichro"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Morichro"]},". If the target escapes your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," ends for any reason, you cannot maintain ",{"tag":"i","children":["Morichro"]}," on your next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
